'''Bean Cats''' are a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 2.3 Update|Version 2.3]] and can be unlocked by clearing [[Greece (Empire of Cats)|Greece]] (滋賀県, Shiga-ken, '''Shiga Prefecture''') for the first time. Their [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] which increased health, gain [[Resistant]] towards [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]], level 1 [[Wave Attack]], and [[Behemoth Slayer]].

