==Trivia==
*The bright blue coloration of Val Val Cat's armor is likely a reference to [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Lenneth|Lenneth]] from the [[wikipedia:Valkyrie Profile|''Valkyrie Profile'']] series.
**Incidentally, [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] also has a winged headpiece similar to Lenneth's.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], the Bean Cats are a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] and can be unlocked via [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]].
*They and [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]] were the only two Cat Units needing [[Invite Friends to get Moneko|Invitation Codes]] to unlock until [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].
*Prior to [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]], Val Val Cat's English description mistakenly said it had Colossus Slayer instead of Behemoth Slayer.
*Unlike its previous forms, Val Val Cat's name isn't pluralized even though it still consists of two cats.
*At a little under 9 years, Bean Cats holds the record for the third longest delay between a unit's initial release and the release of their True Form, with [[Midsummer Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|Midsummer Rabbit]] and [[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|Li'l Gau]] both beating them by less than a year.

